      "id": "sol.amc-8-1998-p16.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "This would be the year the population is \\(30\\) times as much as in \\(1998.\\) This means the population triples approximately \\(3\\) times, making the year approximately \\(3\\cdot 25=75\\) years after \\(1998.\\) This would be \\(2073,\\) so \\(2075\\) is the best approximation.\n\nThus, the correct answer is B .",
      "hints": [
        "Compare \\(6000\\) with the starting population \\(200.\\)",
        "Three triplings are close to a factor of \\(30.\\)"
      ],
